{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54214","headline":"驻紫霞观 · 方干","name":"驻紫霞观","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"易觉春光老，难消夏昼长。\n问囚伤道气，嚼句疗饥肠。\n殿古苔痕涩，坛高松桧凉。\n黄冠谁可语，试与辩亡羊。\n（见民国二十五年刊陈善同等纂《重修信阳县志》卷三十）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54214.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54214","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}